	"data": ".openclaw Directory Cleanup — 2026-08-29\n\nFull review delivered 3 AM Aug 29 (Signal). Phase 1 executed ~9 AM with cithoreal's go-ahead. Everything trashed via gio trash (recoverable from ~/.local/share/Trash), nothing rm'd.\n\nReview findings (3 AM)\nTotal: 14GB, about a third reclaimable\nBig fish (3.4G) — agent databases: main 902M, four cron agents ~650M each (journal-analyst, vault-steward, thoughtbubbles-researcher, accountant). Live DBs — retention investigation needed, not hand-hacking. →…",
